  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Chipped</h1><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BAscRYKm/images/cbbeeca232f2632aef4ac4856f80c2e7566a4461.png\" alt=\"Chipped\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/I80VLV.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"由 Terrarium 製作\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fresourceful-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/jUWHY2.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"需要 Resourceful Lib\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fathena-ctm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=http://images.teamresourceful.com/u/TNilje.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"需要 Athena\"></a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p>你是否曾想用砂岩大磚建造一座史詩級城堡？或是用地獄熔岩打造一座純粹的地獄要塞？又或者只是想用泥土蓋間小屋，或用惡名昭彰的花崗岩面孔做根圖騰柱？無論你要做什麼，我們都能滿足你！</p>\n<p>Chipped 是一款 1.16+ 的建築模組，擴展了遊戲中可使用的方塊種類。模組提供超過 11,000 種獨特的建築方塊，從彩色玻璃的各種變化，一路到混凝土、海磷石，甚至金合歡黑石！不僅所有紋理都是手工以原版風格繪製，還包含了許多由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fathena-ctm\" rel=\"nofollow\">Athena</a> 驅動的連接紋理！</p>\n<p>靈感來自廣受歡迎的 Chisel 模組，Chipped 讓建築者能夠盡情發揮創造力，因為每個方塊都值得擁有一個夥伴！</p>\n<p>要開始使用，你只需製作七張工作檯中的一張，它們能讓你把各種原版方塊轉換成 Chipped 的變體。所有工作檯外觀不同但功能相同，因此你可以挑選最適合你建築風格的一張，或製作幾張不同的，並把它們分散擺放在家中。無論你想做什麼，Chipped 都能助你實現夢想！</p>\n<br>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/r9FApKUUDnE?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<h4>程式設計師：</h4>\nGrim、Alex Nijjar、MsRandom1、CodexAdrian、ThatGravyBoat\n<h4>美術設計：</h4>\nKekie6、Marc-IceBlade、Shrimp、Facu、Frogipher、SunsetSoup、Valilla、Brother Earth、Joosh、ArtistMonster、Zilver</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/514923/description_c1dc4fb6-bae9-4212-a47f-d7a3a4dea600.jpg\" alt=\"與好友同樂的最佳方式。使用 Essential Mod 一起玩\" width=\"837\" height=\"164\"></a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">✨社群連結✨<br><br></h3>\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutube.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Youtube\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/terrariumearth\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/twitch-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Twitch\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftwitter.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/twitter-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkofi.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Kofi\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTerrarium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/terrariumearth/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"display:inline\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"display:inline\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div>\n<h3>看看我們的其他作品<br><br></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fhandcrafted\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/9DjUsr.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"Handcrafted\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fchipped\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/lRunun.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"Chipped\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fad-astra\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/snZW6z.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"Ad Astra\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252ftempad\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/HPp8Fo.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"Tempad\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fspirit\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/SQ4Me7.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"Colorful Azalaeas\" width=\"96\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fargonauts\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/05PfzF.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"Lil Wings\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fcadmus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/YqZ7Hf.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"Vitalize\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fheracles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/RzlEoy.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"Spirit\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fprometheus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/DP8PUz.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"Reaper\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fcommon-storage-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=http://images.teamresourceful.com/u/wP2ReQ.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"Experience Obelisk\" width=\"96\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"display:inline\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
